<title>USA: Tengasco names James Kaiser CFO.</title>
<headline>Tengasco names James Kaiser CFO.</headline>
<dateline>KNOXVILLE, Tenn. 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tengasco Inc said Friday it had named James Kaiser as its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Kaiser previously worked at the Kingsport, Tenn., law firm of Hunter, Smith &amp; Davis, where his primary practice area was oil, gas and mineral law, Tengasco said.</p>
<p>The company was not available to comment on Kaiser's predecessor.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
